WEBVTT

00:04:30.167 --> 00:04:32.851
Kenya's creative industry is dynamic,

00:04:32.875 --> 00:04:34.726
cosmopolitan, forward-looking,

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.018
and without a doubt,

00:04:36.042 --> 00:04:39.167
a true manufacturing industry
of the immediate future.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:45.559
But its true power lies in its ability
to help heal the psyche of Kenya,

00:04:45.583 --> 00:04:48.875
so we can finally build a nation for real.

00:04:49.958 --> 00:04:51.226
Thank you.

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:56.726
(Applause)

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.268
(Applause)

00:04:59.292 --> 00:05:01.851
For this song, I'd like us all
to take a minute